OL,3,APip benefits review expected to push
OL,4,Afor quicker payments for some disabled
OL,5,Apeople
OL,6,
OL,7,FA review into the main disability
OL,8,Fbenefit in England and Wales is due to
OL,9,Fbe published shortly
OL,11,FThe report on personal independence
OL,12,Fpayment (Pip) is set to recommend that
OL,13,Fpeople with the most severe conditions
OL,14,Fand terminal illnesses should get
OL,15,Fquicker payments
OL,17,FIt's understood the report, co-chaired
OL,18,Fby the disability minister Sir Stephen
OL,19,FTimms, won't suggest major savings
OL,20,Fdespite costs being projected to more
OL,21,Fthan double between 2020 and 2030
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
