OL,3,APrince William meets Burnham on first
OL,4,ADowning Street visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales walked up Downing
OL,7,FStreet for the first time, as he
OL,8,Fvisited Prime Minister Andy Burnham.
OL,10,FBehind the black door of No 10, Prince
OL,11,FWilliam is expected to talk to Burnham
OL,12,Fabout issues including homelessness,
OL,13,Fwith both the PM and the prince
OL,14,Fcommitted to tackling the problem.
OL,16,FThe two men have met before, such as
OL,17,Fthe Omani state visit last month, where
OL,18,Fthey both attended the state banquets
OL,19,Fat Windsor Castle.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
